<title>USA: PSE to trade Swift Energy options Jan 31.</title>
<headline>PSE to trade Swift Energy options Jan 31.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said Wednesday it would list options on shares of Swift Energy Co on January 31.</p>
<p>The options would open with strike prices of 30, 35 and 40 and expirations in February, March, April and July, the exchange said. It said position limits have been set at 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Swift Energy shares were up 5/8 at 34-1/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>The PSE said Swift Energy options have been allocated to lead market maker Sheldon Kahn. ((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
